<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 94.663)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 04/01/2006    101.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 04/01/2007</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Wednesday, December 11, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on January 7, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
